tem-title\">\n                                <a href=\"https://softwareengineeringdaily.com/\" target=\"_blank\">AI-Powered Threats to the Software Supply Chain</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Discussion about security risks and AI-related vulnerabilities in software supply chains, examining how AI can both threaten and protect software infrastructure.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">technical</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">Software Engineering Daily</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">2025-08-04</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-header\">\n                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n                            <div class=\"item-title\">\n                                <a href=\"https://blog.google/technology/ai/\" target=\"_blank\">Google Announces Jules AI Coding Agent</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Google announced their asynchronous coding agent called Jules, made available to everyone through both free and paid plans.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">technical</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">Google</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">2025-08-05</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-header\">\n                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n                            <div class=\"item-title\">\n                                <a href=\"https://softwareengineeringdaily.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The Terminal as an Agentic Interface</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Discussion with Zach and Gregor Vand about Warp's evolution and why terminals may be better suited than IDEs for agentic AI development.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">technical</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">Software Engineering Daily</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">2025-08-06</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-header\">\n                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n                            <div class=\"item-title\">\n                                <a href=\"https://medium.com/@gauritr01/part-1-react-ai-agents-a-guide-to-smarter-ai-through-reasoning-and-action-d5841db39530\" target=\"_blank\">ReACT AI Agents: A Guide to Smarter AI</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Explains the ReAct (Reasoning and Acting) framework for building smarter AI agents that combine chain-of-thought reasoning with tool execution.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">tutorial</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">Gauri Trivedi</span>\n                            <span class=\"source\">2025-08-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"footer-list\">\n            <a href=\"#\">Guidelines</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">FAQ</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">API</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Legal</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Contact</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Search</a>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <a href=\"#\">Archive</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Beta</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Submission</a>\n        </div>\n        <p style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #828282;\">\n            Compiled: August 11, 2026 | Sources: Meta AI, Sinch, Devin, GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI, Google\n        </p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
